<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In family life,</l><l>Save me from trying to please man.</l><l>Filial duties,</l><l>Financial burdens,</l><l>Lord, keep my joy amidst these!</l><l>What of these health conditions?</l><l>How to share? How to bear? How to care?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the church life,</l><l>Save me from natural zeal.</l><l>“Strange fire,” (Lev. 10:1)</l><l>Cultural standards,</l><l>Lord, replace these for the oneness!</l><l>How shall I shepherd another?</l><l>What to pray? What to bring? What to say?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
